+4. **Long jobs.** Keep any single job under 45 minutes. Run long jobs in the background and poll them.
+5. **Honesty.**
+   - Label every claim **PROVED**, **CHECKED-2** (two independent implementations agree), **COMPUTED-1** or
+     **CONJECTURE**.
