+   569	  a promotion by σ or a checkmate of σ̄. Stalemate and infinite play are not wins. The defining clauses are:
+   570	  - with σ to move, a position is a P-win if σ has a legal move that promotes or leads to a P-win;
+   571	  - with σ̄ to move, a position is a P-win if σ̄ is not stalemated (it has a legal move, or it is in check) and
