+- New pattern -> `.claude/context/memory/learnings.md`
+- Issue found -> `.claude/context/memory/issues.md`
+- Decision made -> `.claude/context/memory/decisions.md`
+
+> ASSUME INTERRUPTION: If it's not in memory, it didn't happen.
