  2055	  decisive event of G for White is closing by (V2-ctx); a promotion by Black would be a ⊖ option of a Black node of
  2056	  W^White, and there is none); Black's shuttle, a D-move (legal by Lemma 3.2″) whose rank is lower because the pass is
  2057	  an option of a Black node of W^White; any other move, closing by (Pun_Black).
  2058	- (S3): Black's shuttle is a legal move, so Black is not stalemated (Lemma 3.2″).
  2059	The sharp form gives a P-win. ∎(a)
